cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Probatio: an agent skill for rigorous review of your own scientific manuscripts"
message: "If you use this skill in published work, please cite it using these metadata, and the sources listed in the README's Sources and credits section."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Aravind
    family-names: Vijayaraghavan
    affiliation: "University of Manchester"
repository-code: "https://github.com/aiam-nano/probatio"
url: "https://github.com/aiam-nano/probatio"
abstract: "Probatio (skill id manuscript-review) is an Agent Skill that reviews a scientific manuscript the user owns: five criterion-targeted passes, an adversarial pass with a steelman filter, claim verification against the whole manuscript, and a pre-delivery integrity gate. It produces an author-facing prose report and a complete findings list, each finding anchored to a verbatim quotation, and supports successive review rounds."
